---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import AdsterraArticleBanner from '../../components/AdsterraArticleBanner.astro';

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Does Scavland have co-op right now?',
    a: 'No. Scavland is strictly singleplayer in Steam Early Access (Update 0.8.0 / Hotfix 0.8.8). The Steam store page lists only Single-player, and the current build contains no networking or online co-op features.'
  },
  {
    q: 'When is co-op coming to Scavland?',
    a: 'Co-op is officially confirmed on the development roadmap at scavland.com under the update name "Scavland: Blood Brothers (Co-Op)", with a target window of December 15, 2026 to February 28, 2027.'
  },
  {
    q: 'How will co-op work in Scavland?',
    a: 'According to the official roadmap, the Blood Brothers update will allow friends to team up in the Zalesye open world, help a host advance story quests, divide up NPC jobs, and clear procedural bunkers together.'
  },
  {
    q: 'Will Scavland support local split-screen or couch co-op?',
    a: 'No split-screen or local couch co-op has been announced. The planned cooperative multiplayer is designed as online co-op for PC on Steam.'
  },
  {
    q: 'Does Scavland co-op include PvP or friendly fire?',
    a: 'No PvP has been announced. Developer NoShadow has consistently described multiplayer strictly as cooperative survival. There are no battle royale, raid extraction, or deathmatch modes on the roadmap.'
  }
];
---

<Layout
  title="Is Scavland Co-Op? No — Co-Op Planned for Dec 2026–Feb 2027"
  description="No, Scavland does not have co-op yet in Early Access. Official roadmap confirms Blood Brothers co-op update is planned for the Dec 2026–Feb 2027 target window."
  keywords="scavland coop, scavland co-op, is scavland coop, scavland coop release date, scavland multiplayer coop, scavland play with friends, scavland blood brothers"
  canonical="/coop/"
>
  <Fragment slot="schema">
    <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify({
      '@context': 'https://schema.org',
      '@graph': [
        {
          '@type': 'BreadcrumbList',
          itemListElement: [
            { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 1, name: 'Scavland Wiki', item: 'https://scavland.wiki/' },
            { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 2, name: 'Co-Op Status & Guide', item: 'https://scavland.wiki/coop/' }
          ]
        },
        {
          '@type': 'FAQPage',
          mainEntity: faqs.map(f => ({
            '@type': 'Question',
            name: f.q,
            acceptedAnswer: { '@type': 'Answer', text: f.a }
          }))
        }
      ]
    })} />
  </Fragment>

  <article class="article-shell">
    <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="font-size:0.82rem;color:var(--text-muted,#888);margin-bottom:1.25rem;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:0.4rem;align-items:center;">
      <a href="/" style="color:var(--acid,#b9e86c);text-decoration:none;font-weight:600;">Scavland Wiki</a>
      <span style="opacity:0.4;">/</span>
      <span style="color:#bbb;">Co-Op Status</span>
    </nav>

    <header class="article-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Co-Op Status · Updated October 2026 (Update 0.8.0 / Hotfix 0.8.8)</p>
      <h1 class="page-title">Scavland Co-Op Mode &amp; Multiplayer Status</h1>
      <p class="lede">Scavland is strictly singleplayer today in Early Access. Cooperative play is officially planned under the Blood Brothers update targeting the Dec 2026 – Feb 2027 window. Here is the verified status.</p>
      <span class="evidence">Evidence: <a href="/steam/" style="color:var(--acid,#b9e86c);text-decoration:underline;">Official Steam store page</a> (App ID 3373500) &amp; Early Access notes · Official roadmap (scavland.com/roadmap.json) · Verified October 2026</span>
    </header>

    <div class="article-layout">
      <div class="article-content">
        <div class="quick-answer">
          <strong>Quick Answer</strong>
          <p style="margin:0 0 10px;font-size:0.98rem;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;">
            <b>No — Scavland does not have co-op right now.</b> The current Steam Early Access build (Update 0.8.0 / Hotfix 0.8.8) is singleplayer-only. However, co-op is an officially confirmed roadmap milestone: developer NoShadow announced <b>“Scavland: Blood Brothers (Co-Op)”</b> on the public roadmap at scavland.com, with a target release window of <b>December 15, 2026 – February 28, 2027</b>.
          </p>
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:0.88rem;color:var(--text-muted,#aaa);line-height:1.5;">
            Roadmap target windows may shift during development. The dates represent the current development plan rather than a locked launch guarantee.
          </p>
        </div>

        <h2 id="current-status">Current Early Access Status: Singleplayer Only</h2>
        <p>
          Scavland launched into Steam Early Access on September 4, 2026 as a solo tactical survival experience. Across Update 0.8.0 and Hotfix 0.8.8, the game remains dedicated singleplayer:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Steam Store Features:</strong> Tagged strictly as <em>Single-player</em>, with Steam Achievements, Steam Cloud, and Family Sharing. There are no online co-op or LAN tags.</li>
          <li><strong>No In-Game Networking:</strong> The client currently features no peer-to-peer or client-server networking architecture.</li>
          <li><strong>All Entities Are AI:</strong> Every trader, hostile raider squad, and companion in the Zalesye zone is fully controlled by the game's AI engine.</li>
        </ul>

        <div class="article-media">
          <img src="/images/screenshots/ss_04_settlement_camp.webp" alt="Scavland settlement camp — all NPCs and traders in Early Access are AI controlled" loading="lazy" />
          <p class="caption">NPC settlements in Zalesye — current Early Access gameplay is 100% singleplayer</p>
        </div>

        <h2 id="blood-brothers">Official Co-Op Plan: Blood Brothers Update</h2>
        <p>
          Co-op is officially confirmed in primary sources. On October 5, 2026, alongside the one-month Early Access milestone, developer NoShadow published the official interactive roadmap at <a href="https://scavland.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">scavland.com</a>.
        </p>

        <div style="background:var(--panel);border-left:3px solid var(--acid);padding:16px 20px;margin:20px 0;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;">
          <strong style="color:var(--acid);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.85rem;text-transform:uppercase;display:block;margin-bottom:6px;">
            Confirmed Co-Op Mechanics (Blood Brothers)
          </strong>
          <ul style="margin:0;padding-left:18px;font-size:0.92rem;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.6;">
            <li><strong>Open World Teaming:</strong> Explore and survive the radioactive wasteland of Zalesye together with friends.</li>
            <li><strong>Host Story Progression:</strong> Visiting players can join a host's world and help complete main story quests.</li>
            <li><strong>Independent NPC Jobs:</strong> Squad members can divide and tackle different faction contracts simultaneously.</li>
            <li><strong>Procedural Bunker Raids:</strong> Delve into multi-floor subterranean bunkers as a coordinated tactical unit.</li>
            <li><strong>Bunker Hideouts &amp; Customization:</strong> Personal bunker hideout systems and character appearance customization are planned alongside the co-op release.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <AdsterraArticleBanner label="Sponsored Co-Op Intel" />

        <h2 id="roadmap-timeline">Roadmap Timeline &amp; Release Window</h2>
        <p>
          Blood Brothers is scheduled as the third major milestone on the official roadmap:
        </p>
        <div style="overflow-x:auto;margin:20px 0;">
          <table style="width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-size:0.88rem;">
            <thead>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
                <th style="text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;color:var(--acid);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;">Milestone</th>
                <th style="text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;color:var(--acid);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;">Target Window</th>
                <th style="text-align:left;padding:10px 12px;color:var(--acid);font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',monospace;font-size:0.75rem;text-transform:uppercase;">Status</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
                <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:var(--ink);">Community Picks #1</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:var(--text-muted,#bbb);">Sep 1 – Oct 15, 2026</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 12px;"><span style="color:#7ddb8a;">Completed</span></td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
                <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:var(--ink);">The Descent (Bunkers)</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:var(--text-muted,#bbb);">Sep 1 – Dec 15, 2026</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 12px;"><span style="color:var(--acid);">In Progress</span></td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(185,232,108,0.05);">
                <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:var(--ink);"><strong>Blood Brothers (Co-Op)</strong></td>
                <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:var(--text-muted,#bbb);"><strong>Dec 15, 2026 – Feb 28, 2027</strong></td>
                <td style="padding:10px 12px;"><span style="color:#e0b354;">Planned</span></td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);">
                <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:var(--ink);">Beyond Nature (Anomalies)</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 12px;color:var(--text-muted,#bbb);">Feb 28 – Jun 1, 2027</td>
                <td style="padding:10px 12px;"><span style="color:#e0b354;">Planned</span></td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <h2 id="coop-faq">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        {faqs.map(f => (
          <div style="background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 20px;margin:12px 0;border-radius:4px;">
            <strong style="color:var(--acid);display:block;margin-bottom:6px;font-size:0.95rem;">{f.q}</strong>
            <p style="margin:0;font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.65;">{f.a}</p>
          </div>
        ))}

        <h2 id="related-resources">Related Guides &amp; Status Hubs</h2>
        <div class="related-grid">
          <a href="/multiplayer/"><strong>Multiplayer Overview</strong><br/>Comprehensive multiplayer &amp; PvP status breakdown</a>
          <a href="/guide/scavland-coop-and-multiplayer-mechanics/"><strong>Co-op Tactics Guide</strong><br/>Solo extraction strategies and squad mechanics</a>
          <a href="/release-date/"><strong>Release Date &amp; Roadmap</strong><br/>Early Access milestones and updates timeline</a>
          <a href="/updates/"><strong>Update Changelogs</strong><br/>Update 0.8.0 and Hotfix 0.8.8 patch notes</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="toc" aria-label="On this page">
        <strong>On this page</strong>
        <a href="#current-status">Current Status</a>
        <a href="#blood-brothers">Blood Brothers Co-Op</a>
        <a href="#roadmap-timeline">Roadmap Timeline</a>
        <a href="#coop-faq">Co-Op FAQ</a>
        <a href="#related-resources">Related Guides</a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
